<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE plist PUBLIC "-//Apple//DTD PLIST 1.0//EN" "http://www.apple.com/DTDs/PropertyList-1.0.dtd">
<!--
  Run one probe inside the logged-in GUI ("Aqua") session, from an ssh shell.

  This is the only way to test anything session-dependent on the G5 without
  sitting at it, and there are more such things than you would expect: the
  pasteboard is unreachable over ssh and from a detached `screen`
  (PasteboardCreate -> -4960), while CGDisplayBaseAddress works fine in both --
  so "capture works, therefore this will" is exactly the wrong inference, and
  the only way to find out is to run the code where the agent runs.

  It is what established that the clipboard works at all: probes/clipwatch.c
  started this way reported `PasteboardCreate = 0` and then watched a real
  pasteboard for eight minutes while markers were pushed through the agent.

  Usage, from the host. Point ProgramArguments at the probe, then:

      scp rustdesk-ppc-agent/deploy/probe-in-aqua.plist \
          ppctiger:~/Library/LaunchAgents/com.rustdesk.probe-aqua.plist
      ssh ppctiger 'launchctl unload -S Aqua ~/Library/LaunchAgents/com.rustdesk.probe-aqua.plist
                    rm -f ~/probe-aqua.log
                    launchctl load -S Aqua ~/Library/LaunchAgents/com.rustdesk.probe-aqua.plist'
      ssh ppctiger 'tail -f ~/probe-aqua.log'

  **`-S Aqua` is the whole trick and is missing from Leopard's `launchctl load`
  usage text.** Without it, launchctl filters by the *caller's* session type,
  matches nothing against LimitLoadToSessionType Aqua, and says "nothing found
  to load". `unload` needs it too, or the job keeps running.

  No KeepAlive: a probe should run once and stop. Unload it when finished --
  a stale entry here is a job launchd will try to start at every login.

  Build the probe with **-fno-gcse**, like everything else this project compiles
  for the G5. clipwatch was first built at plain -O2 and died on its first loop
  iteration; see docs/BACKLOG.md item 1e.
-->
<plist version="1.0">
<dict>
    <key>Label</key>
    <string>com.rustdesk.probe-aqua</string>

    <key>ProgramArguments</key>
    <array>
        <string>/Users/admin/ppc-probes/clipwatch</string>
    </array>

    <key>RunAtLoad</key>
    <true/>

    <!-- The point of the file. -->
    <key>LimitLoadToSessionType</key>
    <string>Aqua</string>

    <key>StandardOutPath</key>
    <string>/Users/admin/probe-aqua.log</string>
    <key>StandardErrorPath</key>
    <string>/Users/admin/probe-aqua.log</string>
</dict>
</plist>
